  "note": "Ps22 (40 chars). Forsaken righteous. Trust-thread batach x5 (fathers v4-5, God-made v9, mockers quote v8). lev heart melted v14. Reversal v24: man bazah despised (v6) but God NOT bazah despised nor sathar hidden his face. Praise-half: darash seek, zakar remember, ends of earth turn. Poetic ledger; span-id pairs.",
  "spans": {
